# computatrum

Computatrum: an agent that uses your computer for you, from ComputaCo. Today it is a desktop app; this package will be its programmable interface.

This is version 0.0.1. It holds the name `computatrum` for ComputaCo and has no functions yet: it is not a working
package. The real code will be published under this name in a later version.

- ComputaCo: https://computaco.ai
- The hosted API's clients today: `computerworld-cloud` on npm and PyPI (https://github.com/ComputaCo/computerworld)
- The open engine: https://github.com/ComputaCo/computerworld-engine

MIT licence.
